{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1000_se", "source_sha256": "24c31f989f88a82a88dfc62a10434446743fdf02b2ab6e72496dc9c6c45b0424", "ja": "（わああああああーーっ！）", "zh": "（哗啊啊啊啊啊啊──！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fc01d7e0f4147328fbe6825c4951808b06718bf36468bd4e61b7826f7a4facb3", "ja": "公演の幕が下りても、歓声が鳴り止まない……。\n百合子、お疲れさま！　いいステージだったぞ！", "zh": "公演落幕以后，欢呼声也没停歇……\n百合子，辛苦你了！表演很精彩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "03193968d25d854c525396f02eff065398cb0ee857a41a204e2c47362ac7ec3e", "ja": "うう……でも、{$P$}さん……。\n私の勇気は、もう消えちゃいそうです……。", "zh": "呜呜……可是{$P$}先生……\n我的勇气好像要消失了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0784f258fca964d67e9c63c10358784850e4e09539141d54b145f07ec5ff9201", "ja": "ええっ！？　と、突然どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦咦！？怎、怎么会突然这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "011a7b1604aeb4662c8833f11bebb91b6875a94b83c84b0926ddbb8fd271e94e", "ja": "実は私、このステキな衣装でライブができるって\n知ってから、ずっとワクワクが止まらなくて……。", "zh": "其实我自从知道可以穿这么棒的服装表演以后，\n心底就一直雀跃得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "8ebda317088f47e9e5fd1304cfe24770fafaf2b7cdbc91b86578141d49b29c25", "ja": "それで、この衣装ならではのMCを\n私なりにいろいろ考えたんです。", "zh": "然后，我自己想了不少\n穿这套服装才办得到的主持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "940dea43d5caca5b9d25354e8c976cc546df64746469abb733b6078d96f254e8", "ja": "私好みの衣装を用意してもらったんですから、\nその期待に応えようって思って……。", "zh": "你辛苦准备了符合我喜好的服装，\n所以我想努力回应你的期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "52b296c3c897610324d4f82553555d926c0ffcecc12c6f48d7fa53247a38e894", "ja": "ちゃんと魔術書を操る魔法使いらしく、\nカッコイイ呪文みたいな決めゼリフを唱えようって！", "zh": "于是我决定要像个运用魔法书的魔法使，\n念一些很帅的咒语当决胜台词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "92d8ae3a325aab469658681f6a635ce2ab91e9a0228a13907348a942c1665bab", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。そういう期待は別に……\nいや、前向きでいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "原、原来你在想这些，但我其实没有这种期待……\n没事，这么积极我觉得很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7712889e34df456673428dbe46d837920802f5789d2c0b5208473012f224477c", "ja": "なのにどうして、勇気が消えちゃいそうなんだ？", "zh": "不过你为什么会说勇气快消失了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "863a8ebbecbd150bec3d15be7d5882fccda12bc033c353257fca81232e03399b", "ja": "それが……私、すっかり舞い上がっちゃって……\n言おうと思ってた台詞も呪文も、全部飛んじゃって……", "zh": "这是因为……我整个人太开心……\n把想说的台词跟咒语都忘光了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddaf286dc14c10f8e31eeb8f95d35cfe3d903ba4b2c58263c2006bf54838bf9f", "ja": "ううっ、ごめんなさい{$P$}さん！\n私、やっぱり偉大な魔法使いにはなれませんでした～！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生，对不起！\n我果然当不了伟大的魔法使～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ba8f809acae71fcebd382d415a2de627a079b61b89d04e6ec7517aecd00670f2", "ja": "そ、そうか……。よし、とりあえず落ち着こう。\nほら深呼吸、深呼吸して。", "zh": "这、这样啊……好，总之你先冷静一点。\n来，深呼吸，深呼吸喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "000977eeeb62ac9f8fa96e303ac37fcb3256d7b3902ae427adacba60e4eaaf37", "ja": "は、はい……す～、は～……す～、は～……。\nちょ、ちょっと落ち着いてきました……。", "zh": "好、好的……（吸气～吐气～吸气～吐气～）\n我、我稍微冷静了下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "904766d4a2372c6da80d7fdedcb85567a548c36e8971793c5e1108214dded331", "ja": "落ち着いたなら、何か聞こえてこないか？", "zh": "冷静下来以后，有没有听见什么声音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "f4d6ff2278092f7b49fea56e39791ce3cb0a8af8627848e668c45636ff74a2ae", "ja": "え？　聞こえるって何が……。あっ。", "zh": "咦？听见什么声音……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1016_se", "source_sha256": "ca2b2a18c6821c6af6c7466e266cb47c4985a6907d5e3565e1075ef3c2115820", "ja": "（アンコール！　アンコール！！）", "zh": "（安可！安可！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "18b54155af0aeabff57f51429b42c024c038320e0a5f4575e7cc078a79fc28a1", "ja": "みんなが……私を呼んでる……！", "zh": "大家……在呼唤我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "70580dedcd250a463d7b7be11c5ed1478c8700c860f9e9eb7a327f9a03309b77", "ja": "呪文は唱えられなかったかもしれないけど……\nちゃんと魔法はかけられたみたいだぞ！", "zh": "咒语虽然没有念成功……\n但你的魔法似乎还是奏效了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "80c43b994be2bb11283f15a6903013172a934381757315084bab5b10d47dc4e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b6a0a1599e5dd1a30503537f6928149ba4e2e871391ec98d2f7b3af1694e4064", "ja": "ほら、魔法使いとして、魔法をかけた\n責任をとらないと。……準備はいいか？", "zh": "来，你既然是魔法使，\n就得负起施法的责任才行……准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "a737f3d874b790d860356ab3c58eaf119e8ae9dba4953e8551c95f3b8ab05f65", "ja": "はいっ。……私、大丈夫です！\nアンコール、がんばれます！", "zh": "好了……我没问题！\n安可，我行的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "f8702f95097d061c9c01de9c114aeb6b25af0c5170e0797ab1cfddccc9c9a136", "ja": "あっという間に勇気がわいてきました。\nなんだか私が魔法にかけられたみたい……。", "zh": "一下子就涌出了勇气，\n感觉被施法的人变成我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0084_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "b1b1dcfe96405303792240955a0fdeb6f233e495a964299ada5fccf82d2df634", "ja": "あ、実はファンのみんなと{$P$}さん\nこそが、真の魔法使いってことですね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊，其实粉丝和{$P$}先生\n才是真正的魔法使吧！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
